Try it with all gems.  All hard gems are valuable.  Some colors,
as soon as you know it's hard you know which gem it is.  Other
colors there are 2 possibilities.

Some soft gems are valuable and some are not.  Worthless glass
is far more common.  Once you know a gem is soft, #name it and
toss it to a coaligned unicorn.  It will reject #name's
worthless gems.  #name them worthless and from then on you
know all other gems of that color are valuable soft or hard.

It is usefull to keep one hard gem available to engrave the
E word.  Other gems can be sold until you have all the gold
from shopkeepers.  The more expensive gems are worth carrying
to the endgame to increase your score if you like high scores.

